  {
    "episode_id": 80574,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80574.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "Welcome everybody to this edition of the Untold Story. I'm Martha McCallum and it's great to have you with us. We have been living through an incredibly intense historic news cycle and I am very happy to have Byron Donald's Congressman from Florida. joining me today. He represents the Southwest Florida District 19. And Congressmen, I know our viewers are very familiar with you, obviously, and your work and your career. But for anyone who isn't, I always like to start the untold story by asking you to just give us a minute of sort of your background, how you grew up, where you came from, and what motivates you in terms of your political frame of reference.",
