        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Audience familiarity with the guest enhances engagement and trust.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Personal background stories provide meaningful context for political perspectives.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The host's role includes guiding the narrative and framing discussions.",
        "confidence": 0.87
