  {
    "episode_id": 80574,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80574.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, it's interesting. Sometimes it takes when all of us are more of age and working to start to realize the difference between conservative and liberal policies in action and how they impact our lives and what we think about that. It's interesting hearing about your background and how you grew up. And I just want to ask you, because I know It's not easy growing up without a father figure for anyone from any background. What was the impact of that on you and your own thoughts as a dad because I've seen you with your with your son and you're a wonderful dad.",
