    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80574.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "Well, I mean, look, you just don't have that role model at home. And things between my mom and my dad didn't work out. And that's just the way it was. My mom really had to be mom and dad. And that's tough for anybody to be able to do. So she did the best job she could. So I think the impact on me was you just didn't have a male role model to lean on, to kind of see what the goal line is supposed to be for adolescents or",
