  {
    "episode_id": 80574,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80574.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "You know, I'm curious what your thoughts are about the developments in the past few days, and there have been a lot of them. So President Biden has dropped out of the race. And Kamala Harris, the vice president, is now the presumptive nominee of the party. And there's been a tremendous amount of enthusiasm around that. She has raised a ton of money. It kind of feels like there's been a resurgence of enthusiasm around the Democratic campaign for the presidency. What do you make of it? What do you think is going to happen?",
