        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Public enthusiasm correlates with fundraising success in presidential campaigns.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "A change in candidate leads to renewed energy within a political party.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s inquiry is meaningful and will elicit useful insights from the listener.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The Democratic Party leadership views Harris as a credible and viable successor.",
        "confidence": 0.87
