  {
    "episode_id": 80574,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80574.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "So let's talk about the three things that seem to be emerging as the thrust of Kamala Harris' campaign. And that is abortion access. democracy, saving democracy, and freedom as a larger sense. These are the three emerging centerpieces of the campaign. So let's start with abortion rights and the freedom for women to get abortion. And there's a lot of discussion about Iowa, which now has a six-week ban. Your thoughts on that is an issue in this election.",
