      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s interpretation of the campaign’s priorities reflects a shared understanding among voters and analysts.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "A six-week abortion ban in Iowa represents a significant restriction on reproductive rights.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
