    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "What do you say to that? The true threat to democracy has been the Democrat Party. They were the ones that basically tried to force 80 million people to take the COVID vaccine against their will. They are the ones that suppress the free speech of the American people during COVID-19 era to suppress information, to block information, to shadow ban information. They are the ones that force tens of thousands of our soldiers to leave the military because they didn't want to take the vaccine. They're the ones who defied the Supreme Court on two different occasions with their student loan bailout, and it looked no further than Kamala Harris herself. She's never received a vote to be the nominee in the Democrat primaries, whether it's 2024 or even back in 2020. Nobody's ever voted for her to be the presidential nominee. She got there because the party was scared about losing and so they pushed Joe Biden aside and they are coronating her. Nobody has elected her. She's being coronated. And so all those things are a threat to democracy. I will say this, when Donald Trump and he was president of the United States, the American people had less regulation on their businesses. People were free to speak their minds no matter how they felt. There was no suppression of information or speech, and that will not be the case under a future Trump presidency. So they can lecture about democracy all they want. When you look at the details, it is the Democrat Party that has subverted our constitutional republic, not the Republican Party, not",
